1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,100
People are like books. Some deceive you with their cover. Others surprise you with their content.

2
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:12,960
So don't chase appearances. Time always reveals what words cannot.

3
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:17,640
And the right people will prove themselves without effort.
